        commitName: "Wojciech Gu\u015B\u0107"
        summary: New customizations and texture loading improvements
        description: Added Dracthyr, Earthen, Warlock and new Human Ear customization.
          Removed BLPLib and added that code directly into Unity so files can be
          loaded directly into Texture2D, moved all the texture operations into ComputeShader.
          Both significantly sped up texture loading.
